<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n39795" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίκοιν-ος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>common to many,
			promiscuous</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίκοινον τῶν γυναικῶν</span>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν μεῖξιν ποιεῖσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					4.104
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				172
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				180
			</span></i>; <i>sharing equally in</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λέκτρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Andr.</u>
					124
				</span></i>
			 (lyr.): c. dat., <i>in common with</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρχὴν ἐ. αὐτῷ ἔχειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.C.
					42.44
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἀμφοῖν</span>
			<i>belonging equally</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.368e
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				1018f
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BGU</u>
				906.21
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(i A.D.)</span>: neut. pl. Adv., <i>in
			common</i>, [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γυναιξὶν] ἐπίκοινα χρέωνται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					1.216
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χρηστήριον, τὸ ἐ. ἔχρησε ἡ Πυθίη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					6.77
				</span></i>
			 (but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐχρήσθη</span>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίκοινον χρ</span>. ib.<i><span class="en">
				19
			</span></i>). Regul. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-νως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Orph.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					256
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>. Gramm.,
				<i>common</i>, of gender, <i><span class="en">
				D.T.
				634.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gell.
				13.7.3
			</span></i>. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-νως</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.D.
					<u>Conj.</u>
					253.20
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίκοινος, ἡ</span>,
			a game, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπίσκυρος</span>
			, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Tht.</u>
				146a
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1601.34
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				9.104
			</span></i>.</div>
